<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:27:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>美国芯片限制威胁数据中心繁荣，马来西亚的人工智能野心经受考验</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/insight-with-haslinda-amin-11-25-2026-video</link><description>哈斯琳达·阿明洞察 (Insight with Haslinda Amin) 是一档每日新闻节目，以深入、高调的采访和分析为特色，让观众全面了解重要故事。该节目邀请了商业、金融、政治和文化领域的杰出领导人。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/insight-with-haslinda-amin-11-25-2026-video'&gt;美国芯片限制威胁数据中心繁荣，马来西亚的人工智能野心经受考验&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia's AI Ambitions Tested as US Chip Curbs Threaten Data Center Boom&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/insight-with-haslinda-amin-11-25-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:29:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲在与人工智能抗衡的卢比中发现了一个令人惊讶的货币避风港</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/asia-finds-a-surprise-currency-haven-in-ai-defying-rupee</link><description>印度卢比是本月亚洲表现最好的货币，随着投资者加大对冲人工智能交易的力度，印度股市也随之上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/asia-finds-a-surprise-currency-haven-in-ai-defying-rupee'&gt;亚洲在与人工智能抗衡的卢比中发现了一个令人惊讶的货币避风港&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asia Finds a Surprise Currency Haven in AI-Defying Rupee&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/asia-finds-a-surprise-currency-haven-in-ai-defying-rupee</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:30:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于干旱天气影响作物产量，印度扩大了免税糖进口范围</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-extends-duty-free-sugar-imports-as-dry-weather-hits-crop</link><description>由于厄尔尼诺现象引发的干旱天气限制了世界最大糖消费国的产量，印度将原糖免税进口期限延长了三个月。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-extends-duty-free-sugar-imports-as-dry-weather-hits-crop'&gt;由于干旱天气影响作物产量，印度扩大了免税糖进口范围&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：India Extends Duty-Free Sugar Imports as Dry Weather Hits Crop&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-extends-duty-free-sugar-imports-as-dry-weather-hits-crop</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:44:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</link><description>据知情人士透露，Advent 正在考虑收购法国测试公司 Bureau Veritas SA，这将是今年欧洲公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas'&gt;Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Advent Weighs Takeover Of Testing Firm Bureau Veritas&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着印度转向棕榈油，中国意外的豆油出口热潮降温</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-s-surprise-soyoil-export-boom-cools-as-india-turns-to-palm</link><description>随着棕榈油的竞争力变得更强，印度对中国豆油的兴趣正在减弱，这阻碍了北京意外崛起为主要出口国的步伐。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-s-surprise-soyoil-export-boom-cools-as-india-turns-to-palm'&gt;随着印度转向棕榈油，中国意外的豆油出口热潮降温&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China’s Surprise Soyoil Export Boom Cools as India Turns to Palm&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-s-surprise-soyoil-export-boom-cools-as-india-turns-to-palm</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:53:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>为什么黄仁勋重返英伟达对中国很重要</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-jensen-huang-s-return-to-nvidia-matters-for-china-video</link><description>在围绕黄仁勋的未来和美国新的芯片限制进行了一周的激烈争论后，北京向华盛顿发出了关于贸易休战的明确信息：中国目前正在坚持自己的立场。甘甘 (Nectar Gan) 解释了为什么中国可能会进行长期游戏。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-jensen-huang-s-return-to-nvidia-matters-for-china-video'&gt;为什么黄仁勋重返英伟达对中国很重要&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Why Jensen Huang’s Return to Nvidia Matters for China&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/why-jensen-huang-s-return-to-nvidia-matters-for-china-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:59:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能担忧提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场休整</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;人工智能担忧提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场休整&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tech Selloff Rolls On as AI Worries Lift Bonds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳元/美元：股市下跌，澳元将创四年来最大月度跌幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aud-usd-aussie-set-for-biggest-monthly-drop-in-four-years-as-stocks-fall</link><description>由于全球股市疲软抑制了与经济增长相关的货币需求，澳元周三扩大跌幅，预计将出现 13 年来最大月度跌幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aud-usd-aussie-set-for-biggest-monthly-drop-in-four-years-as-stocks-fall'&gt;澳元/美元：股市下跌，澳元将创四年来最大月度跌幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AUD/USD: Aussie Set for Biggest Monthly Drop in Four Years as Stocks Fall&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aud-usd-aussie-set-for-biggest-monthly-drop-in-four-years-as-stocks-fall</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:28:30 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>